abstract: >
  An intelligent tutoring system for Linear Algebra that leverages
  Claude AI and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to provide
  personalized, Socratic-method learning experiences. Built with
  FastAPI and React, featuring LaTeX rendering, conversation
  management, and progress tracking. Designed for university
  students in the TSIW program at ESMAD.
